# Shared renderer pins for the AI and SDK public-dependency manifests.
# CI reads these exact values before rendering each package independently.
# Regenerate an intentional API change using the same tool and toolchain:
#
#   rustup toolchain install nightly-2026-05-05 --profile minimal
#   cargo install cargo-public-api --locked --version 0.52.0
#   cargo +nightly-2026-05-05 public-api -p PACKAGE --all-features --simplified
#
# Extract foreign path roots as in .github/workflows/ci.yml, excluding the
# package itself, core/std/alloc and built-in primitive type paths; update that
# package's public-api-deps.txt.
# Recheck after integrating concurrent API changes. A renderer-pin change also
# requires regeneration of both manifests and review of the resulting surfaces.
toolchain=nightly-2026-05-05
tool=cargo-public-api@0.52.0
